{"name": "Paperclash Tactics", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"352\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864340/extras/0c2c2d47a18a0e0f0893d3970555ac19.avif?t=1787649095\" width=\"1213\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"160\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864340/extras/a88d8ed823ac68a2abb0cf39d5580a57.poster.avif?t=1787649095\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864340/extras/a88d8ed823ac68a2abb0cf39d5580a57.webm?t=1787649095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864340/extras/a88d8ed823ac68a2abb0cf39d5580a57.mp4?t=1787649095\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><i>Ah, yes. Valiant heroes... Nay, there were heroes among them, to be sure, but the old man is simply embellishing, I assure you. A good half of them were sellswords, if not more. I\u2019ve known this old man since those very days.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"7\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864340/extras/ee6b3bd9c45540a475e62829764bdb55.webp?t=1787649095\" width=\"313\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"352\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864340/extras/75a549efdd0c563863f52890417b0e60.avif?t=1787649095\" width=\"1213\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"176\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864340/extras/deae5c634817de64f14c726e5291fd59.poster.avif?t=1787649095\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864340/extras/deae5c634817de64f14c726e5291fd59.webm?t=1787649095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864340/extras/deae5c634817de64f14c726e5291fd59.mp4?t=1787649095\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><i>There were indeed a great many battles, true enough. But he, as a rule, would merely stand to the side, barking orders and shuffling his cards... Ah, the cards! Go on, old man...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"7\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864340/extras/ee6b3bd9c45540a475e62829764bdb55.webp?t=1787649095\" width=\"313\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"352\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864340/extras/00cc073f92cef914178ef0d4e9e47033.avif?t=1787649095\" width=\"1213\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"160\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864340/extras/74e8ac1b531df42c032051a23a9ae8c3.poster.avif?t=1787649095\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864340/extras/74e8ac1b531df42c032051a23a9ae8c3.webm?t=1787649095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864340/extras/74e8ac1b531df42c032051a23a9ae8c3.mp4?t=1787649095\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><i>When I first met him, there was no such deck. In truth, without me, he would have just stood there and watched his \u201cvaliant heroes\u201d being trampled into the mud.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"7\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864340/extras/ee6b3bd9c45540a475e62829764bdb55.webp?t=1787649095\" width=\"313\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"352\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864340/extras/738f0f38977734402f14827746e41168.avif?t=1787649095\" width=\"1213\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"186\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864340/extras/79978dfdd93c09aa453abe70641373fd.poster.avif?t=1787649095\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864340/extras/79978dfdd93c09aa453abe70641373fd.webm?t=1787649095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864340/extras/79978dfdd93c09aa453abe70641373fd.mp4?t=1787649095\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Wait a minute! He\u2019s far too old to know about that. Clearly, his grandchildren made him read them fairy tales all night again, and he takes the darn things far too much to heart. Last time, I caught him standing on his dresser, shrieking, \u201cI am the terror that flaps in the night!\u201d A ghastly sight, truth be told. Very well, he\u2019s going to be pondering this for a good while longer. Let us skip ahead and continue on the pages of this story!*</i></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Paperclash Tactics is 